                                            "The time of day fixed for such an event."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "088e4a99-2065-321a-b8b1-1177e69f9fc5",
                                        "entry_id": "cb92b903-821f-3344-b8c1-b6d4cd8c39ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The subset of those members of a specific group who are present or available out of the full set of all the members of said group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70ed43e0-0411-4686-84e5-2fe5b726d984",
                                                "sense_id": "088e4a99-2065-321a-b8b1-1177e69f9fc5",
                                                "text": "On paper, the Japanese had come out on top of the engagement; granted, Hiei had taken a worrying level of damage, but Kirishima was still intact, the light cruiser Nagara and four destroyers were likewise good to go, and four more were damaged but operational. Apart from Hiei, only three destroyers were missing from the roll call."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dced582f-54fb-4fe0-9e1a-c413c6fcfd0b",
                                                "sense_id": "088e4a99-2065-321a-b8b1-1177e69f9fc5",
                                                "text": "It’s an astonishing roll call of future talent from when they were still young and hungry in Manhattan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "roll call",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ec708b2-dd70-37fc-8500-97f8bf3e28e3",
